<h2 style="text-align:center">ONE PIECE</h2>

<blockquote>
    <i>
    "Wealth, fame, power…
<br/>
    Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, attained this and everything else the world had to offer.
    And his dying words drove countless souls to the seas.
<br/>
      "You want my treasure?
       You can have it!
       I left everything I gathered together in one place!
       Now you just have to find it!"
<br/>
    These words lured men to the Grand Line in pursuit of dreams greater than theyve ever dared to imagine!
<br/>
    This is the time known as...
<br/>
    <strong>The Great Pirate Era!</strong>"
